# .codacyignore — ignore generated files and dependencies
# Purpose: stop Codacy analyzers (especially PMD) from scanning third-party libs

# Dependency folders
**/node_modules/**
/node_modules/**
node_modules/

# Build / distribution artifacts
**/dist/**
dist/
**/build/**
build/

# Coverage and test outputs
coverage/
**/coverage/**
/.nyc_output/

# Tooling caches
.parcel-cache/
.cache/

# Misc logs and local-only files
*.log

# Keep CI / config / docs
!.github/**
